  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Trigger npm publish on GitHub release creation instead of workflow_call by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/109\n* Add Definition/State toggle to Viewer node detail panel by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/110\n* Add optional contextKey output aliasing to avoid context collisions by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/111\n* Publish Flow demo application to apitomy.io on release by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/113\n* Add optional output mappings to receive-event nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/112\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v2.0.2...v2.0.3",
